    "image_with_text_tjEkad": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_GHjni7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Achievements & Certifications",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_xNq8Db": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <strong>NADCO Tapes & Labels</strong>, quality, compliance, and environmental responsibility are foundational to everything we manufacture. Our certifications reflect our commitment to operational excellence, regulatory compliance, and sustainable innovation.</p><p><strong>ISO 9001:2015 Certified</strong></p><p>NADCO operates under an<strong> ISO 9001:2015</strong>–certified Quality Management System, ensuring consistent product performance, documented processes, traceability, and continuous improvement across all tape and label manufacturing operations.<br/><br/><strong>WBENC Certified Woman-Owned Business</strong></p><p>NADCO is proudly certified by the <strong>Women’s Business Enterprise National Council (WBENC)</strong> — the most widely recognized and respected national certification for women-owned businesses in the United States. This designation reflects our leadership, innovation, and commitment to supplier diversity initiatives.</p><p><strong>UL Authorized Label Supplier</strong></p><p>As a <strong>UL-authorized label supplier</strong>, NADCO manufactures labeling solutions that meet strict safety, durability, and compliance standards required across regulated industries including electrical, industrial, and manufacturing environments.</p><p><strong>LEED® Silver Certified Manufacturing Facility</strong></p><p>NADCO is proud to be <strong>Florida’s first USGBC LEED Silver–certified tape and label manufacturer</strong>.</p><p>Our certification recognizes environmentally responsible manufacturing practices focused on:</p><ul><li>Sustainable facility development<br/></li><li>Improved water efficiency<br/></li><li>Reduced energy consumption and emissions<br/></li><li>Responsible material sourcing<br/></li><li>Waste reduction initiatives<br/></li><li>Enhanced indoor environmental quality<br/></li></ul><p>Our green manufacturing practices help customers meet sustainability goals while supporting healthier communities and reduced environmental impact.<br/><strong><br/>Commitment to Sustainability</strong></p><p>We continuously invest in environmentally responsible technologies and processes to reduce resource consumption, minimize waste, and deliver innovative labeling and tape solutions aligned with modern sustainability standards.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        },
        "button_tWdcX4": {
